1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,715
The eighth arc closed with a balance sheet that fitted on one page.

2
00:00:03,715 --> 00:00:19,208
An adult reader, a rich outsider, and a southern environmentalist sat on the board of the new station: three people, four directions, and a compass that pointed at the northwestern corner of the map.

3
00:00:19,208 --> 00:00:33,312
The northern and eastern factories had agreed to a compromise on pollution: a rubber seal on every pipe, a knife by the fence for the sampling bags, and a bare strip of ground along the bank.

4
00:00:33,312 --> 00:00:40,057
“Basically, we consume the river and we call it industry,” the director said.

5
00:00:40,057 --> 00:00:43,687
“That is the monster we built.”

6
00:00:43,687 --> 00:00:51,046
The statue in the square was of a fairy with a lily, and beside it stood an ambitious plan for a planetary park.

7
00:00:51,046 --> 00:00:59,341
“A burger and a hay field are not the same purchase,” the eastern member said, and the outsider agreed.

8
00:00:59,341 --> 00:01:04,616
“A poison is a poison, wherever it is poured.”

9
00:01:04,616 --> 00:01:14,095
The southeastern and southwestern members wanted a halfway solution; the northeastern and northwest members wanted a full one.

10
00:01:14,095 --> 00:01:24,784
A pen, a buck, and a millionaire's promise: the board had the materials for a compromise, and none of them for a clean decision.

11
00:01:24,784 --> 00:01:30,139
The foremost question was who would own the readings after the project ended.

12
00:01:30,139 --> 00:01:35,504
“Mankind does not own a river,” the environmentalist said.

13
00:01:35,504 --> 00:01:47,693
“It only rents the right to drink from it.” The board adopted a declarative sentence with a hyphen in the middle: community-owned, publicly-read.

14
00:01:47,693 --> 00:01:53,137
The loss of the old scheme was easier to accept than the board had expected.

15
00:01:53,137 --> 00:02:02,417
Against the advice of the plant managers, the members agreed to publish ten years of data with only a side note about the cost.

16
00:02:02,417 --> 00:02:09,276
A millionaire and a billionaire could not fill the gap that an ox and an animal in the field had left.

17
00:02:09,276 --> 00:02:17,256
The southeast and the northeast wanted even more; the red look on the director's face said the scheme was losing.

18
00:02:17,256 --> 00:02:22,025
“Do not contaminate the well,” the outsider said.

19
00:02:22,025 --> 00:02:29,690
The hay, the lily, and the fairy were decoration; the balance sheet was the only document that mattered.

20
00:02:29,690 --> 00:02:36,034
Ten trees, one plant, and a board of four: the compromise was thin.

21
00:02:36,034 --> 00:02:40,979
A republican member joined the board and asked for a written rule.

22
00:02:40,979 --> 00:02:48,010
The river had answered every question they asked it and none of the ones they avoided.
